*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0010
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-09-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 676
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0010.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    05 YRS-EMPLOYED       PIC 9(2).
    *> GROSS ANNUAL INCOME
    05 ANN-INCOME         PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 LOAN-CEILING       PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 2000-LOAN-MULTIPLE
    DISPLAY "LOAN-CEILING=" LOAN-CEILING
    STOP RUN.
2000-LOAN-MULTIPLE.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF YRS-EMPLOYED >= 5
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF YRS-EMPLOYED >= 7
        COMPUTE LOAN-CEILING = ANN-INCOME * 4
    ELSE
        *> STANDARD EMPLOYMENT MULTIPLE
        IF YRS-EMPLOYED >= 2
            COMPUTE LOAN-CEILING = ANN-INCOME * 3
        ELSE
            COMPUTE LOAN-CEILING = ANN-INCOME * 1.5
        END-IF
    END-IF.
